<Placemark><name>5 → 바벨론 → 갈그미스 → 하맛 → 하솔 → 예루살렘</name><description>바벨론 사절단 — '모두 바벨론으로 옮겨지리라'</description><styleUrl>#l8F9BFF</styleUrl><MultiGeometry><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>44.42090,32.53640,0 44.05163,32.67803,0 43.68752,32.82734,0 43.32855,32.98434,0 42.97474,33.14903,0 42.62608,33.32141,0 42.28257,33.50147,0 41.94422,33.68923,0 41.61101,33.88467,0 41.28296,34.08779,0 40.96006,34.29861,0 40.64231,34.51711,0 40.32971,34.74331,0 40.02227,34.97719,0 39.71997,35.21875,0 39.42283,35.46801,0 39.13084,35.72495,0 38.84400,35.98958,0 38.56232,36.26190,0 38.28578,36.54191,0 38.01440,36.82960,0 37.97089,36.73034,0 37.92535,36.63258,0 37.87777,36.53633,0 37.82815,36.44160,0 37.77649,36.34837,0 37.72279,36.25665,0 37.66705,36.16644,0 37.60928,36.07773,0 37.54947,35.99054,0 37.48762,35.90486,0 37.42373,35.82068,0 37.35780,35.73801,0 37.28983,35.65686,0 37.21983,35.57721,0 37.14779,35.49907,0 37.07371,35.42244,0 36.99759,35.34731,0 36.91943,35.27370,0 36.83923,35.20160,0 36.75700,35.13100,0 36.72165,35.01175,0 36.68376,34.89392,0 36.64334,34.77752,0 36.60038,34.66254,0 36.55488,34.54900,0 36.50685,34.43687,0 36.45627,34.32618,0 36.40317,34.21691,0 36.34752,34.10907,0 36.28934,34.00266,0 36.22862,33.89767,0 36.16537,33.79411,0 36.09957,33.69198,0 36.03125,33.59127,0 35.96038,33.49200,0 35.88698,33.39414,0 35.81104,33.29772,0 35.73256,33.20272,0 35.65155,33.10915,0 35.56800,33.01700,0 35.56549,32.95126,0 35.56150,32.88593,0 35.55602,32.82099,0 35.54905,32.75645,0 35.54060,32.69231,0 35.53066,32.62857,0 35.51923,32.56523,0 35.50632,32.50228,0 35.49192,32.43974,0 35.47603,32.37759,0 35.45866,32.31585,0 35.43980,32.25450,0 35.41945,32.19356,0 35.39762,32.13301,0 35.37430,32.07286,0 35.34949,32.01311,0 35.32320,31.95376,0 35.29542,31.89481,0 35.26615,31.83625,0 35.23540,31.77810,0</coordinates></LineString><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>35.23540,31.77810,0 35.25384,31.79052,0 35.23360,31.79804,0 35.23540,31.77810,0</coordinates></Linea