<Placemark><name>57 → 립나 → 하솔 → 예루살렘</name><description>★ 성전이 불타던 날</description><styleUrl>#lFF4D4D</styleUrl><MultiGeometry><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>36.51670,34.41670,0 36.48522,34.33590,0 36.45206,34.25624,0 36.41723,34.17771,0 36.38071,34.10033,0 36.34251,34.02408,0 36.30263,33.94898,0 36.26108,33.87501,0 36.21784,33.80217,0 36.17293,33.73048,0 36.12633,33.65993,0 36.07806,33.59051,0 36.02810,33.52223,0 35.97647,33.45510,0 35.92315,33.38910,0 35.86816,33.32423,0 35.81149,33.26051,0 35.75314,33.19792,0 35.69310,33.13648,0 35.63139,33.07617,0 35.56800,33.01700,0 35.56549,32.95126,0 35.56150,32.88593,0 35.55602,32.82099,0 35.54905,32.75645,0 35.54060,32.69231,0 35.53066,32.62857,0 35.51923,32.56523,0 35.50632,32.50228,0 35.49192,32.43974,0 35.47603,32.37759,0 35.45866,32.31585,0 35.43980,32.25450,0 35.41945,32.19356,0 35.39762,32.13301,0 35.37430,32.07286,0 35.34949,32.01311,0 35.32320,31.95376,0 35.29542,31.89481,0 35.26615,31.83625,0 35.24100,31.84700,0 35.24060,31.84637,0 35.24020,31.84573,0 35.23980,31.84510,0 35.23940,31.84446,0 35.23900,31.84383,0 35.23860,31.84319,0 35.23820,31.84256,0 35.23780,31.84192,0 35.23740,31.84129,0 35.23700,31.84066,0 35.23660,31.84002,0 35.23620,31.83939,0 35.23580,31.83875,0 35.23540,31.83812,0 35.23500,31.83748,0 35.23460,31.83685,0 35.23420,31.83622,0 35.23380,31.83558,0 35.23340,31.83495,0 35.23300,31.83431,0 35.23271,31.83366,0 35.23243,31.83301,0 35.23214,31.83235,0 35.23186,31.83170,0 35.23157,31.83105,0 35.23128,31.83039,0 35.23100,31.82974,0 35.23071,31.82909,0 35.23054,31.82842,0 35.23037,31.82774,0 35.23020,31.82707,0 35.23002,31.82640,0 35.22985,31.82573,0 35.22968,31.82506,0 35.22951,31.82438,0 35.22934,31.82371,0 35.22929,31.82310,0 35.22923,31.82248,0 35.22918,31.82187,0 35.22913,31.82126,0 35.22908,31.82064,0 35.22903,31.82003,0 35.22898,31.81942,0 35.22893,31.81880,0 35.22888,31.81819,0 35.22893,31.81756,0 35.22898,31.81693,0 35.22903,31.81630,0 35.22908,31.81567,0 35.22913,31.81503,0 35.2