<Placemark><name>76 → 게룻김함 → 헤브론 → 브엘세바 → 다바네스</name><description>말씀을 거부하고 애굽 다바네스로</description><styleUrl>#l5CC98A</styleUrl><MultiGeometry><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>35.21500,31.73000,0 35.21149,31.71882,0 35.20774,31.70777,0 35.20376,31.69686,0 35.19954,31.68610,0 35.19508,31.67547,0 35.19039,31.66497,0 35.18546,31.65462,0 35.18029,31.64440,0 35.17489,31.63433,0 35.16924,31.62439,0 35.16337,31.61459,0 35.15725,31.60492,0 35.15090,31.59540,0 35.14431,31.58601,0 35.13748,31.57677,0 35.13042,31.56766,0 35.12312,31.55868,0 35.11558,31.54985,0 35.10781,31.54116,0 35.09980,31.53260,0 35.09009,31.51526,0 35.08003,31.49823,0 35.06963,31.48151,0 35.05888,31.46510,0 35.04779,31.44901,0 35.03636,31.43323,0 35.02457,31.41775,0 35.01245,31.40260,0 34.99997,31.38775,0 34.98716,31.37321,0 34.97399,31.35899,0 34.96049,31.34508,0 34.94663,31.33147,0 34.93244,31.31819,0 34.91789,31.30521,0 34.90300,31.29254,0 34.88777,31.28019,0 34.87219,31.26815,0 34.85627,31.25642,0 34.84000,31.24500,0 34.71111,31.20125,0 34.58190,31.16068,0 34.45235,31.12327,0 34.32248,31.08902,0 34.19229,31.05795,0 34.06176,31.03004,0 33.93091,31.00531,0 33.79972,30.98374,0 33.66822,30.96533,0 33.53638,30.95010,0 33.40422,30.93803,0 33.27172,30.92914,0 33.13891,30.92341,0 33.00576,30.92084,0 32.87229,30.92145,0 32.73848,30.92522,0 32.60435,30.93217,0 32.46990,30.94228,0 32.33511,30.95555,0 32.20000,30.97200,0</coordinates></LineString><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>32.20000,30.97200,0 32.21903,30.96044,0 32.22182,30.97906,0 32.20000,30.97200,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></MultiGeometry></Placemark>
