<Placemark><name>92 → 벧엘 → 예루살렘</name><description>★ 스가랴 — 네 금식이 잔치로</description><styleUrl>#lF06BA8</styleUrl><MultiGeometry><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>35.22170,31.93000,0 35.22065,31.92225,0 35.21979,31.91451,0 35.21911,31.90680,0 35.21861,31.89909,0 35.21829,31.89141,0 35.21815,31.88374,0 35.21820,31.87609,0 35.21843,31.86845,0 35.21884,31.86083,0 35.21944,31.85323,0 35.22021,31.84564,0 35.22117,31.83807,0 35.22231,31.83052,0 35.22363,31.82298,0 35.22514,31.81546,0 35.22683,31.80795,0 35.22870,31.80047,0 35.23075,31.79299,0 35.23298,31.78554,0 35.23540,31.77810,0</coordinates></LineString><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>35.23540,31.77810,0 35.24075,31.79758,0 35.21939,31.79276,0 35.23540,31.77810,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></MultiGeometry></Placemark>
